# Hand-written. triplePattern [6]: FOCUS as subject with an IRI, a literal or `_` as object,
# FOCUS as object with an IRI or `_` as subject, with and without whitespace.
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> <http://data.example/o>}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> "o"}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> "o"@en}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> "o"^^<http://schema.example/dt>}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> 1}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> -1.5e3}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> false}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{FOCUS <http://schema.example/p> _}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{<http://data.example/s> <http://schema.example/p> FOCUS}@<http://schema.example/S>,
{_ <http://schema.example/p> FOCUS}@START,
{FOCUS<http://schema.example/p>_}@START,
{_<http://schema.example/p>FOCUS}@START,
{
  FOCUS
  <http://schema.example/p>
  _
}
@
START
